0 306 313 [
[([framp~] takes as input a rectangular-windowed FFT)]
[(and outputs, for each FFT channel, the estimated)]
[(amplitude and frequency of any component feeding)]
[(that channel. A sinusoidal component should appear)]
[(in four components \050or three in the special case)]
[(of a sinusoid exactly tuned to a bin.\051 Frequency)]
[(output is in bins, i.e., units of SR/N.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 306 202 [
[(The estimation is done according to the hop-1)]
[(trick described in Puckette&Brown, Accuracy of)]
[(Frequency Estimates Using the Phase Vocoder, using)]
[(a Hann window. A more sophisticated version of)]
[(this technique is used in the [sigmund~] object.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
